        "en": "The label has conditions, age limits or notes for children; the label sentence is quoted below."
      },
      "quote": "The safety and efficacy of colchicine in children of all ages with FMF has been evaluated in uncontrolled studies.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-colcrys",
          "section": "8.4"
