        "en": "Label: use with caution in older adults, usually starting at the low end of the dose range."
      },
      "quote": "In general, dose selection for an elderly patient with gout should be cautious, reflecting the greater frequency of decreased renal function, concomitant disease or other drug therapy [see Dose Modification for Coadministration of Interacting Drugs (2.4) and Pharmacokinetics (12.3) ] .",
